Icon font generated with [icomoon.io](https://icomoon.io).

To add new icons:
1. Upload `icomoon.json` to the [icomoon.io web app](https://icomoon.io/app) and add the new icons.
2. Download the font and replace `icomoon.woff` (and `icomoon.json`) in this directory.
3. Add a `.icon-NAME:before { content: "\eXXX"; }` rule for each new icon in `_sass/icons.scss`.
